              <run fontsize='10'>The Dashboard shows the resulting clusters of the *current elasticity* estimation methodology plus spatial analysis. There are two types of clusters, Low or High, based on the CVR3 sensitivity towards delivery fees. Only entities and cities with clusters are shown.</run>
